## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Sustain Combo (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Hunter Strike, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Hunter Strike, War Axe, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use against physical EXP lanes with light crowd control where Valor stacks decide the first two waves.; Brute Force Breastplate over Malefic Roar when Use when you are starting fights often and need stacking movement speed, control-duration reduction, and durability before armor penetration.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use against shield or regen-heavy front lines before they stack enough Physical Defense to make Malefic Roar mandatory.; Oracle over Immortality when Use when repeated skirmishes matter more than one final revive and your stacked Heavy Left Punch shields decide the trade.
- Total cost: 11240 gold

Default EXP setup for stable ranked games. Hunter Strike lets Paquito convert a full skill cycle into chase speed, while War Axe plus Queen's Wings replaces old spell-vamp-first paths with current sustain and cooldown value.

### EXP Burst Pickoff (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Blade of the Heptaseas, Blade of Despair, Immortality
- Core: Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Blade of the Heptaseas
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy draft has physical lane pressure but no reliable chain control to punish the all-in.; Queen's Wings over Blade of Despair when Use when the first dive is being answered by burst damage and you need Demonize plus spell vamp to finish the combo.; Brute Force Breastplate over Blade of Despair when Use when you still need to play pickoff angles but cannot afford to be stopped by the first control chain.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use when anti-heal is required against Estes, Angela, Esmeralda, or sustain fighters before armor stacking becomes the main problem.
- Total cost: 11850 gold

High-damage EXP setup for drafts where Paquito can isolate a side target. Assassin emblem, Heptaseas, and Blade of Despair reward clean fog entries, but the build loses value when he has to front-line.

### Jungle Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Hunter Strike, War Axe, Blade of the Heptaseas, Malefic Roar, Queen's Wings
- Core: Hunter Strike, War Axe, Blade of the Heptaseas
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Immortality over Queen's Wings when Use for the deciding Lord fight when one revive is worth more than mid-fight sustain.; Blade of Despair over Queen's Wings when Use when your lanes are winning and Paquito can keep invading instead of absorbing the first counter-engage.; Brute Force Breastplate over Blade of the Heptaseas when Use when the enemy has enough control to stop your first jungle entry and you need stacking durability more than out-of-combat burst.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use when the enemy jungler or EXP laner relies on regen or shields during Turtle and Lord contests.
- Total cost: 11070 gold

Jungle setup for tempo drafts that want Paquito to fight early river skirmishes. Ice Retribution helps him stay attached after Jab or Flicker angles are unavailable.

